<h2 id="limitations">12. Limitations &amp; Assumptions</h2>
<ul>
<li>2D domain (no out-of-plane variation)</li>
<li>Single-step EDOT oxidation kinetics</li>
<li>Constant electrolyte conductivity</li>
<li>No convective transport</li>
<li>Simplified Poisson nucleation model</li>
<li>Film growth does not modify domain geometry</li>
</ul>

